~ start
Shark: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], this is some dialogue.
do _add_recipt()
=> END

~ introduction_game
Shark: You really wanna start this business huh...
- Yeah what about it
	Shark: Lotta sass for someone who needs my money
- I'm excited about it
	Shark: Yeah yeah yeah, just be sure to pay me back my money
- ...
	Shark: Cat got your tongue,...[wait=0.5] doesn't really matter to me
Shark: doesn't matter
Shark: Just show me what you got
do _add_recipt()
set speaking_title = "introduction_mid_talk"
=> END

~ tutorial_walk
Shark: How you liking the bar
Shark: Walk around the bar see how it is
do _tutorial_enabler("Keys")
set speaking_title = "tutorial_walk_wait"
=> END

~ tutorial_walk_wait
if _check_tutorial():
	=> tutorial_walk_finished
else:
	Shark: You haven't seen the whole property yet
	Shark: Keeping walking buddy
=> END

~ tutorial_walk_finished
Shark: How you liking it 
- It's alright
	Shark: No problem buddy
- It's kinda lacking
	Shark: Yeah, if I was broke this the only thing I would get also
set speaking_title = "introduction_game"
=> END

~ night_2_introduction
Shark: Not bad... [wait=0.5] for your first day
Shark: Whoa new drinks in the back already
set emo = "mad"
Shark: Where's that blood coming from

- It's from me
	Shark: EWW
- Don't worry bout it
	Shark: Dude don't stab me for it
	Shark: We're good yeah, no hard feelings right?
- ...
	Shark: ...
set emo = "happy"
Shark: Welp, if it's making that dough, doesn't matter does it
Shark: Give me a drink while you at it
do _add_recipt()
set speaking_title = "introduction_mid_talk"
=> END

~ introduction_mid_talk
Shark: Why are you still talking to me
Shark: Start making my drink
=> END

~ introduction_mid_bad
set emo = "mad"
Shark: Did you just give me straight gasoline you punk
Shark: Is this really what I'm putting my money into...
Shark: Remember [wait=0.5] I'll tear this place down if you're tanking my wallet
Shark: Good luck buddy
do GameState.main_node.night_popup()
do _give_payment()

do _leaving()
=> END

~ introduction_mid_mid
set emo = "netural"
Shark: Hey this isn't half bad
Shark: I could get this somewhere better
Shark: I see the vision... 
Shark: Good luck man
do GameState.main_node.night_popup()
do _give_payment()

do _leaving()
=> END

~ introduction_mid_good
set emo = "happy"
Shark: Hey this is pretty good
Shark: Not bad kiddo I would get another if I didn't have other business to tear up
Shark: I feel my money coming back
Shark: Yeah you got that, I believe
do GameState.main_node.night_popup()
do _give_payment()

do _leaving()
=> END

~ mid
Scott: Finished
=> END

~ finish
Scott: Finished
=> END